WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:03.426
打开Composer / Open Composer

2
00:00:03.426 --> 00:00:06.429
新建认证演示请求 / Create an authentication example request

3
00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:09.432
填写自有localhost服务地址 / Enter the owned loopback service address

4
00:00:09.432 --> 00:00:12.826
无认证发送得到401 / Send without authentication and receive 401

5
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:15.775
打开Auth / Open Auth

6
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:18.888
选择Basic / Choose Basic

7
00:00:18.888 --> 00:00:21.835
填写公开演示用户名 / Enter the public example username

8
00:00:21.835 --> 00:00:24.775
填写仅本机有效的演示密码 / Enter the loopback-only example password

9
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:27.930
发送Basic并核对200 / Send Basic and verify 200

10
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.975
切换到Bearer / Switch to Bearer

11
00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:33.929
填写公开演示token / Enter the public example token

12
00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:37.018
发送Bearer并核对200 / Send Bearer and verify 200

13
00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:40.018
切回None / Switch back to None

14
00:00:40.018 --> 00:00:43.226
核对自动Authorization已移除 / Verify automatic Authorization was removed

15
00:00:43.226 --> 00:00:46.137
打开Headers添加显式字段 / Open Headers for an explicit field

16
00:00:46.137 --> 00:00:49.026
填写Authorization名称 / Enter the Authorization name

17
00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:51.977
填写同一公开Bearer值 / Enter the same public Bearer value

18
00:00:51.977 --> 00:00:54.927
添加这条显式Header / Add the explicit Header

19
00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:58.032
None不删除显式Authorization / None does not remove explicit Authorization

20
00:00:58.032 --> 00:01:01.033
删除自己的显式Authorization行 / Delete the explicit Authorization row

21
00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:04.119
核对请求不再带认证字段 / Verify the request no longer carries authentication

22
00:01:04.119 --> 00:01:07.227
返回Basic清理演示输入 / Return to Basic to clear example inputs

23
00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:10.176
清空演示用户名 / Clear the example username

24
00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:13.127
清空演示密码 / Clear the example password

25
00:01:13.127 --> 00:01:16.133
返回Bearer / Return to Bearer

26
00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:19.077
清空演示token / Clear the example token

27
00:01:19.077 --> 00:01:22.074
最终保持None / Finish with None

28
00:01:22.074 --> 00:01:25.070
确认Composer没有写入Capture / Verify Composer did not create Capture records
